### 1. Metadados do Serviço
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/diagnostico/modelo
User-Agent: Tester-Audit-Agent
Accept: application/json

### 2. Predição - Perfil A (alto risco: contrato mensal, fibra, cliente novo)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/predict
User-Agent: Tester-Audit-Agent
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenure": 2,
  "MonthlyCharges": 95.7,
  "TotalCharges": 191.4,
  "Contract": "Month-to-month",
  "InternetService": "Fiber optic",
  "PaymentMethod": "Electronic check",
  "PaperlessBilling": "Yes",
  "TechSupport": "No",
  "OnlineSecurity": "No"
}

### 3. Predição - Perfil B (baixo risco: contrato de 2 anos, cliente antigo)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/predict
User-Agent: Tester-Audit-Agent
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenure": 66,
  "MonthlyCharges": 60.2,
  "TotalCharges": 3973.2,
  "Contract": "Two year",
  "InternetService": "DSL",
  "PaymentMethod": "Credit card (automatic)",
  "PaperlessBilling": "No",
  "TechSupport": "Yes",
  "OnlineSecurity": "Yes"
}

### 4. Entrada Inválida - texto em campo numérico (espera HTTP 422)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/predict
User-Agent: Tester-Audit-Agent
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenure": "invalido",
  "MonthlyCharges": 70.0,
  "TotalCharges": 500.0,
  "Contract": "Month-to-month",
  "InternetService": "DSL",
  "PaymentMethod": "Mailed check",
  "PaperlessBilling": "No",
  "TechSupport": "No",
  "OnlineSecurity": "No"
}

### 5. Entrada Inválida - valor fora dos limites (MonthlyCharges negativo) (espera HTTP 422)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/predict
User-Agent: Tester-Audit-Agent
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenure": 10,
  "MonthlyCharges": -50.0,
  "TotalCharges": 500.0,
  "Contract": "One year",
  "InternetService": "DSL",
  "PaymentMethod": "Mailed check",
  "PaperlessBilling": "No",
  "TechSupport": "No",
  "OnlineSecurity": "No"
}

### 6. Entrada Inválida - categoria inexistente (espera HTTP 422)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/predict
User-Agent: Tester-Audit-Agent
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenure": 10,
  "MonthlyCharges": 50.0,
